(per pair column: the indices of its two change columns). `S4BK3`, `S4PB`: bucket structures of
the certificate check (`s4three`, `s4full`). The data were produced outside Lean; nothing here is trusted:
every property used is checked by kernel `decide` in `GeoSeq/S4Cert*.lean`, `GeoSeq/S4Check.lean`.
